  "Clipping": "削波",
  "You can add MAVLink commands to the command selection of Planner View's Mission Grid. \nTo add a command, you have to know the ID. The name will automatically be filled out if the\nID is already defined in the MAVLink libraries. You can also add an ID that is not yet defined.\nIn this case, you have to give the name as well. Adding a command here does not mean that the\nautopilot will accept or execute it. So you have to know what you are doing.": "您可以在规划器任务表的命令选择中添加 MAVLink 命令。\n添加命令时必须知道其 ID。如果 MAVLink 库已定义该 ID，名称会自动填写。\n也可以添加尚未定义的 ID，此时必须同时填写名称。\n在此添加命令并不表示飞控会接受或执行它。请确认您了解该命令的用途。",
  "Speed": "速度",
  "Acceleration": "加速度",
  "Enable or disable Hardware flow control": "启用或禁用硬件流控制",
  "maximum frequency in kHz ": "最高频率，单位 kHz ",
  "number of frequency hopping channels ": "跳频通道数 ",
  "the percentage of time to allow transmit": "允许发射的时间百分比",
  "Listen Before Talk threshold": "先听后发阈值",
  "minimum frequency in kHz ": "最低频率，单位 kHz ",
  "GPI1_1R/COUT Sets GPIO 1.1 as R/C(PPM) output": "GPI1_1R/COUT 将 GPIO 1.1 设为遥控 (PPM) 输出",
  "GPI1_1R/CIN Sets GPIO 1.1 as R/C(PPM) input": "GPI1_1R/CIN 将 GPIO 1.1 设为遥控 (PPM) 输入",
  "Serial baud rate in rounded kbps. So 57 means 57600. \n": "串口波特率以取整的 kbps 表示，例如 57 表示 57600。\n",
  "AIR_SPEED is the inter-radio data rate in rounded kbps. So 128 means 128kbps. Max is 192, min is 2. I would not recommend values below 16 as the frequency hopping and tdm sync times get too long. ": "AIR_SPEED 是电台间的空中数据速率，单位为 kbps。例如 128 表示 128 kbps，最大 192，最小 2。不建议低于 16，否则跳频和时分复用同步耗时过长。",
  "NETID is a 16 bit 'network ID'. This is used to seed the frequency hopping sequence and to identify packets as coming from the right radio. Make sure you use a different NETID from anyone else running the same sort of radio in the area. ": "NETID 是 16 位网络 ID，用于生成跳频序列并确认数据包来自正确的电台。请确保与附近同类型电台使用不同的 NETID。",
  "TXPOWER is the transmit power in dBm. 20dBm is 100mW. It is useful to set this to lower levels for short range testing.\n": "TXPOWER 是发射功率，单位为 dBm。20 dBm 等于 100 mW。近距离测试时可设置为较低值。\n",
  "ECC is to enable/disable the golay error correcting code. It defaults to off. If you enable it then you packets take twice as many bytes to send, so you lose half your air bandwidth, but it can correct up to 3 bit errors per 12 bits of data. Use this for long range, usually in combination with a lower air data rate. The golay decode takes 20 microsecond per transmitted byte (40 microseconds per user data byte) which means you will also be a bit CPU constrained at the highest air data rates. So you usually use golay at 128kbps or less. \n": "ECC 用于启用或禁用 Golay 纠错码，默认关闭。启用后，数据包发送字节数翻倍，空中有效带宽减半，但每 12 位数据可纠正最多 3 位错误。适合远距离通信，通常配合较低的空中数据速率使用。Golay 解码每传输字节耗时 20 微秒（每用户数据字节 40 微秒），在最高数据速率下也会受到 CPU 限制。因此通常在 128 kbps 或更低速率下使用。\n",
  "OPPRESEND enables/disables \"opportunistic resend\". When enabled the radio will send a packet twice if the serial input buffer has less than 256 bytes in it. The 2nd send is marked as a resend and discarded by the receiving radio if it got the first packet OK. This makes a big difference to the link quality, especially for uplink commands. \n": "OPPRESEND 用于启用或禁用“机会重传”。启用后，若串口输入缓冲区少于 256 字节，电台会将数据包发送两次。第二次发送会标记为重传；如果接收端已正确收到第一次数据包，就会丢弃重复包。这能显著改善链路质量，尤其是上行命令。\n",
  "AES Encryption Level": "AES 加密级别",
  "The number of output frames for SBUS or PPM missing before enters failsafe.": "SBUS 或 PPM 连续丢失多少个输出帧后进入失控保护。",
