  "Survey in information\nValid: is the survey in valid\nInProgress: are we currently surveying in our position\nDuration: the number of seconds we have surveyed in\nObs: number of obsivation used in our survey in\nAcc: current accuracy of our survey in point\n": "基站位置测定信息\nValid：测定结果是否有效\nInProgress：是否正在测定位置\nDuration：已测定的秒数\nObs：测定使用的观测次数\nAcc：当前测定位置的精度\n",
  "Automatically Configure Receiver": "自动配置接收机",
  "Automatically configure the receiver attached to the selected port to output correction messages.": "自动配置所选端口上的接收机，使其输出差分改正消息。",
  "At connect the receiver  will start a “survey-in” to determine the GPS precision location.\nThe survey-in is finished when the RTCM Base location is no longer changing.\nBased on the location and signal it could take a couple minutes\n\nOnce the survey is completed, you are ready to go.\n": "连接后，接收机将开始“测定基站位置”，以确定精确的 GPS 位置。\n当 RTCM 基站位置不再变化时，测定完成。\n根据位置和信号情况，这可能需要几分钟。\n\n测定完成后即可使用。\n",
  "RTCM Constellation Usage": "RTCM 卫星星座",
  "Choose what constellations the receiver outputs corrections for. More constellations result in a higher data rate.": "选择接收机为哪些卫星星座输出改正数据。星座越多，数据速率越高。",
